          "date": "2026-10-05 23:04:48.000000000",
          "tz": -420
        },
        "subject": "LU-20861 build: support ->create() without excl argument",
        "message": "LU-20861 build: support ->create() without excl argument\n\nLinux commit v7.2-rc1-9-gb2f1e6301efa (\"Remove excl arg to ->create\ninode_operation\") dropped the bool excl argument from\ninode_operations.create(), so ll_create_nd() and memfs_create_nd() no\nlonger match the ops table type on v7.3.\n\nAdd a configure check for the four-argument form and select the\nmatching signature for both callbacks. ll_create_nd() used excl only\nin its debug message, and memfs_create_nd() ignored it. Remove excl\nfrom the ll_create_nd() debug message.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5.5\nSigned-off-by: Chell Laszlo <pumpkinbiscuit@proton.me>\nChange-Id: Ib362f146cd737acc6ab2734ce237f4a7fce0b813\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
